          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_L4Vcah": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What makes Taylor Chip Protein Cookies unique?",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Gh77YY": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We’re not just another “high protein” brand — we’re rebuilding the nutrition space from the ground up. Most protein snacks are made with cheap oils, artificial sweeteners, and low-quality proteins that do more harm than good. We said no to all of that. <strong>TCN is the world’s first truly nutritious, seed-oil-free protein cookie</strong> — designed to taste like dessert but built to fuel your best self. Every ingredient is intentional:<br/></p><ul><li><strong>A2 grass-fed dairy</strong> for better digestion and higher bioavailability</li><li><strong>Collagen peptides</strong> to support joints, skin, and recovery</li><li><strong>Organic Soft Red Winter Wheat</strong> for a soft, indulgent texture that’s easier on the gut</li><li><strong>No seed oils, no soy, no garbage fillers — ever</strong></li></ul><p>We don’t chase trends. We chase truth. Because health shouldn’t come at the cost of taste — and indulgence shouldn’t come at the cost of your health.<br/><br/></p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
